# --- DISCOVERIES 10-24 (optional, no quest needs them): the stranded drivers' camp (a note), the road crew's digger,
# a maintenance hatch with a chest, a buried treasure, a viewpoint on the south hills --------------------------------
place campfire_1 - at 40 42 ground sit
place Balboa_DecorationPrefabBase_SimpleTent - at 43 44 ground sit yaw=210
place "Box Small" - at 38 44.5 ground sit
place Note_Paper drivernote at 38 44.5 ground y=0.7 drop yaw=15
place VP_Excavator digger at -32 48 ground yaw=120
prop digger tint.color=#8a6a4e
prop digger tint.amount=0.4
call hatchcache x=-40 z=-44 r=10 seed=10215 alias=roadhatch chest=roadhatchchest items=MetalIngot*2;Bolt*3;Rope*2
call treasure x=-60 z=10 r=10 n=1 seed=10214
prop treasure10214 treasure.loot=CopperOre*3
place Zone_Trigger viewzone at -20 -60 ground
note drivernote Drivers' camp note | LANE 3 - WHO'S STILL HERE\n\nThe Okafors (van, four kids, one goat that is not ours). Dee (bike, opinions). The bus driver, gone down the lane for his toolbox and his dignity.\nWe cook on the bank and watch the road go under a bit more each week. Mrs Okafor says her sister works the night switchboard on the roofs and will have heard something. Dee says the Network has heard plenty and said nothing.\nTonight nobody lit the stove. Dee saw something out where the road goes under - a teal light, sliding along the lane markings like it was reading them.\nWe ate cold beans in the dark and the goat sulked. Tomorrow we walk on along the highway.
prop viewzone zone.id=overpass_view
prop viewzone zone.radius=7
prop viewzone zone.repeat=never
prop viewzone zone.message=From the hills you see the whole highway: up out of the sea at the ramp, over the bank - and its broken end in the air.

# --- Areas (10-24: every story island has places all over it and its quest crosses it): the embankment ridge in the north, a cave in the south-east
# rock, the toll keeper's house in the north-east, a caravan park in the south-west - and a Tangaroa token at each (the toll run)
